#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt:1 of
msgid "Element-wise less-than comparison."
msgstr "按元素进行小于比较。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``<`` operator (``__lt__``), so ``lf < other`` is equivalent"
" to ``lf.lt(other)`` for non-LiteFrame ``other``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``<`` 运算符（``__lt__``），因此对于非LiteFrame的 ``other``，``lf "
"< other`` 等价于 ``lf.lt(other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt of
msgid "参数"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt:6 of
msgid "Value or LiteFrame to compare against."
msgstr "用于比较的值或LiteFrame。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt:9 of
msgid "Lazy boolean LiteFrame indicating where elements are less than ``other``."
msgstr "惰性布尔LiteFrame，指示元素小于 ``other`` 的位置。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt of
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr ""

