msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt:15 of
msgid "Element-wise less-than-or-equal comparison."
msgstr "按元素进行小于等于比较。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.comparison.lt:17 of
